# The protagonist: an ordinary 80s person. Brown hair, denim jacket over an 80s-red shirt,
# grey jeans, white sneakers. Faces right. Format: tools/pixelart/README.md
# Parts used below (rows are top-padded, so frames stand on the bottom edge):
#   head, torso (idle / guard = fists up / punch / raised arm), legs (stand / stride / tucked / falling)
